# Title
Git Commands

## Purpose
This gives instructions for using git 

## Prereqs
Accounts, IPs, tools, access, assumptions.

## Steps
1. init branch
2. Backup

## Commands
```bash
# Init setup
cd ~/kb
git init
git branch -M main

	# Local Commits
cd ~/kb
git add .
git commit -m "Add initial runbooks"

# Setup and push
git remote add origin git@github.com:YOURUSER/kb.git
git push -u origin main
```

